Rave @ Isle Delfino // Featuring : Vector U • James Landino • GameChops • Vgr • Masayoshi Soken • Qumu • and more

//No AI-generated music was used in the curation or performance of this set. Every track was hand-selected and mixed live.

// MESSAGE FROM THE DJ //

I'll be totally honest, I'm NOT super proud of the mixing in this one. I'm not sure why but I just couldn't nail my transitions this time. That said, I really like a lot of the tracks in this one and hope that can carry the mix. This one is full of fun water park and resort themed songs, perfect for a day in the sun, or a late-night
